subckt dut (VSS)
model DIODE diode is=1e-14 n=1
C1 (net3 VSS) capacitor c=470u
D1 (net2 net0) DIODE
Q1 (net2 NC0001 net3 VSS) sky130_fd_pr__npn_05v5_W1p00L1p00 m=1
R1 (net0 VSS) resistor r=100
R2 (net1 net3) resistor r=1k
V1 (net1 VSS) vsource dc=7.2
